{
  "id": "太一",
  "name": "太一",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "star",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": null,
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "chuci-02-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "吉日兮辰良,\n\n东皇太一穆将愉兮上皇。\n\n抚长剑兮玉珥"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "chuci-09-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "虚。\n\n飞朱鸟使先驱兮,\n\n驾太一之象舆。\n\n苍龙蚴虬于左骖兮,"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "chuci-12-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "相佯,\n\n遗光耀兮周流。\n\n望太一兮淹息,\n\n纡余辔兮自休。\n\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "chuci-13-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "置词。\n\n北斗为我折中兮,\n\n太一为余听之。\n\n云服阴阳之正道兮"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-04-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "、辰戌、巳亥是也。\n\n太微者，太一之庭也。紫宫者，太一之居也。轩"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 8,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-08-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "廓之宇，游无极之野；登太皇，冯太一，玩天地于掌握之中，夫岂为贫富"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-09-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "知其他。”此之谓也。\n\n帝者体太一，王者法阴阳，霸者则四时，君者"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-10-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "玄房，各处其宅，守而勿失，上通太一。太一之精，通于天道。天道玄默"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 16,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-16-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "地，浑沌为朴，未造而成物，谓之太一。同出于一，所为各异，有鸟有鱼"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 24,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-24-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "道》者，卢牟六合，混沌万物，象太一之容，测窈冥之深，以翔虚无之轸"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "chuci",
    "chapterIndex": 2
  }
}
